    sh:description "A roadway is a communication route constructed for traffic. According to the General State Administration's address system, it includes streets, roads of all types, paths, waterways, pontoons, etc. It also includes pseudo-routes, that is, anything that complements or replaces a roadway. In our case, this term is used to refer to urban roads."@en,
